  "question": "Can the previously identified 《北京图书馆馆史资料汇编（二）》 pp.446—449 target be more tightly bound to the Tieqin Tongjian Lou acquisition context from an authoritative public source, and is there a concrete lawful physical holding route for direct collation?",
  "answer": "Yes, but only at a bounded citation/access layer. A 2024 article hosted by the National Library of China / 中国古籍保护网 discusses the early PRC Qu-family/Tieqin transfer, quotes a Beijing-Library intake assessment that '这些善本入藏本馆，本馆中文书藏地位将益形重要，可为全国之冠', and places reference [23] immediately after that quotation; [23] is 《北京图书馆馆史资料汇编（二）：1946—1966》 pp.446—449. Separately, Tokyo Metropolitan Library's public Digital BookShelf exposes the 1997 upper volume under displayed shelf sequence 0161 / 1 / 2-1. The project still has not directly reviewed pp.446—449, does not know the exact internal document title reproduced there, and cannot bind the target 3482/3483 volume to purchase or donation.",
